#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Use the [`Neat` class](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) to analyze the noise impact on an Estimator workload.\n"
"- Review detailed [Sampler examples](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) tutorial.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"- Usa la [clase `Neat`](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) para analizar el impacto del ruido en una carga de trabajo del Estimator.\n"
"- Revisa ejemplos detallados del [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Revisa ejemplos detallados del [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Practica con primitivas siguiendo la [lección de función de costo](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) en IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Aprende a transpilar localmente en la sección [Transpile](/guides/transpile).\n"
"- Prueba el tutorial [Comparar configuraciones del Transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
